          "content": "<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Chuẩn bị câu trả lời cho các câu sau, sử dụng các từ vựng, cấu trúc, câu học được phía trên và từ bài Listening.</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Xem thêm trong phần Gợi ý trả lời: <a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: #0d638f; text-decoration-line: none; outline: 0px; border-radius: 0px !important; text-shadow: none !important;\" href=\"http://docs.google.com/document/d/1dV_0DcDLS3aE23nvlFdHQbQC1v3je2G-/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=116087920410815633677&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Gợi ý</a></strong></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">DESCRIBING PEOPLE: </strong></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">1. What does your father look like?</span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">2. What does your mother look like?</span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">3. What does your brother/ sister look like?</span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">4. What kinds of clothes does he/she often wear? (gộp vào 3 câu trên, miêu tả ngoại hình + các loại quần áo thường mặc luôn)</span></span></p>\n<p><strong>Viết câu trả lời đầy đủ cho từng câu hỏi vào file google docs và nộp lại.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>GV feedback xong thì học thuộc lòng câu trả lời.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Sau khi được GV hướng dẫn thêm trên lớp, HV tiếp tục hoàn thiện câu trả lời và luyện tập.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #c0392b; border-radius: 0px !important; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Link google docs (mở quyền nhận xét cho GV)</strong></span></span></span></p>",
